00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:11.580
- [Narrator] Raise your
hand if you think the mole

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:14.580
is still in the box and you
would like to continue the game.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:20.200
- I couldn't focus on all of
the people that were playing,

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:23.394
but I felt that the people that
were out were not the moles.

00:09:23.394 --> 00:09:26.850
- [Narrator] All right, that
means that the game ends here.

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:29.790
If the lights turn green that
means you voted the mole out

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:31.020
and you all win!

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:33.400
However, if the lights turn red,

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:36.244
that means the mole is still
in the box and you lose.

00:09:36.244 --> 00:09:38.911
(intense music)

00:09:42.202 --> 00:09:46.460
(group gasps)
- I knew it, I knew it!

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:49.390
- Will the mole please reveal themselves?

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:50.223
In three,

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:52.430
two,

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:53.263
one.

00:09:56.364 --> 00:09:57.631
- (exhales) Sorry guys.

00:09:57.631 --> 00:10:00.087
- What? (laughs)
- Sorry.

00:10:00.087 --> 00:10:03.110
- I feel so dumb.
- Oh, don't, don't.

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:06.042
So I've been on both sides.

00:10:06.042 --> 00:10:09.623
(crying) I've been cheated
on and I've been the cheater.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:16.700
When I first (sniffles)
applied to do this,

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:21.010
I had like only one intention in mind,

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:25.720
is to give purpose to my pain.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:28.650
I was cheated on in college. (sniffles)

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:31.120
He was the first person
who ever made me feel

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:33.670
like I was enough. (crying)

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:35.160
So then when he cheated on me,

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:39.970
I felt like he took that
away from me. (sniffling)

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:42.170
And I've been struggling
with it ever since.

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:46.290
For me, the greatest pain
wasn't being cheated on,

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.820
but being the person
who inflicted the pain

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:50.600
that I already knew so well.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:53.380
You knew better, why didn't you do better?

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:56.680
You know, so that was
just like, ah, it just hit

00:10:56.680 --> 00:10:59.160
- It felt like she was all of our exes,

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:01.160
telling us what we needed to hear.

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:02.130
And I mean, we couldn't have asked

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:03.140
for a better mole than Mary Anne,

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:05.440
because she really gave
us that moment to heal.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.130
And she was a great like surrogate

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:09.830
for everyone who had been hurt

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:13.310
to get that kind of closure, I suppose.

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.083
- So Mary Anne, the floor is yours.

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:20.220
- Even though I won, I-

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:22.610
I don't wanna take it.

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:24.720
I actually wanna give this prize money

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:27.750
to the people who've been cheated on.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:31.330
So if I can invite everyone
that was with me, right?

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:34.960
To come up stage, we're gonna
win this celebratory money,

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.814
and I'm gonna give this to you guys.

00:11:36.814 --> 00:11:40.231
(emotional violin music)

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:43.360
So this money is going to you guys,

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:46.350
I'm not gonna keep any of it. (laughs)

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:47.882
You guys can just buy
me drink, if you want.

00:11:47.882 --> 00:11:48.810
(group laughing)

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:50.190
Everyone's hands in,

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:52.520
on three, two, one.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.385
♪ Money, money, money, money ♪

00:11:54.385 --> 00:11:55.218
- I'll throw it.

00:11:55.218 --> 00:11:56.377
- Gonna throw it up in the air.

00:11:56.377 --> 00:11:57.620
- All right, we're all
gonna pick it up in the end,

00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:58.453
but you know, why not?

00:11:58.453 --> 00:12:01.160
We're just gonna do the little, bam!

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:03.730
(group cheering)

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:04.563
- To trauma!

00:12:04.563 --> 00:12:07.447
- (laughs) To trauma.
(group laughing)

